# ADR-003

**Date:** 2026-07-31

**Status:** Accepted

## Decision

Each bike size is stored as an independent database record.

## Rationale

Different sizes have different geometry.

Treating each size independently simplifies searching, filtering and fit calculations.

## Consequences

Example:

Specialized Tarmac SL8 52

Specialized Tarmac SL8 54

Specialized Tarmac SL8 56

Each is stored as its own record.

